{"id": "t024-057", "text": "elena's leaving do fri at 6, the crown. she's off to a new job at the bbc 3rd of march", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "elena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "fri at 6", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the bbc", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of march", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t024-058", "text": "helen's grandson Femi starts uni at warwick next mon, computer science, first in the family to go. she's dropping him off sun w his mum, they've bought him enough pot noodles for a yr. helen's worried he wont eat properly. he's doing the freshers rugby trials wed at 4", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "grandson", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni at warwick", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next mon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "computer science", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "first in the family to go", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dropping him off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sun", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "freshers rugby trials", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "wed at 4", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t024-059", "text": "shanice's mum's 70th surprise party sat 14 june 7.30 at the cricket club, dont tell her. shanice's dad is getting her out the house w a fake dinner at 6. shanice's brother Andre doing the music. we're chipping in for a weekend away in the cotswolds, need to send shanice £30 by fri", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "shanice", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th surprise party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat 14 june 7.30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "shanice", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "6"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "shanice", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send shanice £30", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "shanice", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by fri", "anchor": "a1"}]}
